@host = https://localhost:7038
### 1. List patients
GET {{host}}/api/patients
Accept: application/json

### 2. Known patient
GET {{host}}/api/patients/0f8fad5b-d9cb-469f-a165-70867728950e
Accept: application/json

### 3. Unknown patient (valid GUID, not in the list)
GET {{host}}/api/patients/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Accept: application/json

### 4. Malformed id (not a GUID)
GET {{host}}/api/patients/abc
Accept: application/json

### 5. OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json

### 6. Register a patient (valid) → 201 + Location
POST {{host}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Sara",
  "lastName": "Willems",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-04-12"
}

### 7. Missing firstName → 400 ValidationProblemDetails
POST {{host}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lastName": "Willems",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-04-12"
}

### 8. Over-posting attempt: client tries to choose the id → ignored
POST {{host}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999",
  "firstName": "Tom",
  "lastName": "Maes",
  "dateOfBirth": "1978-09-01"
}

### 9. Missing dateOfBirth → 400 (thanks to DateOnly?)
POST {{host}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Lena",
  "lastName": "Claes"
}

### 10. Wrong content type → 415
POST {{host}}/api/patients
Content-Type: text/plain

firstName=Lena

### 11. Health → 200 Healthy
GET {{host}}/health

### 12. Unhandled exception → 500 ProblemDetails, no stack trace (DEV ONLY endpoint)
GET {{host}}/api/diagnostics/throw

### 13. Referral policy from configuration
GET {{host}}/api/referral-policy